## Cloudflare Pages response headers.
## COOP/COEP make the page cross-origin isolated, which unlocks SharedArrayBuffer
## and therefore multi-threaded WASM. GitHub Pages cannot set these at all — that
## is the reason this project targets Cloudflare Pages. See docs/DECISIONS.md.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), interest-cohort=()
  ## No connect-src beyond 'self': the app must not be able to phone home even by accident.
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'wasm-unsafe-eval'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' blob: data:; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
